  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302128eddc57d4034f817ab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老是让你看到自己\r\n不想让人看见的那一面呢。\r\n……不过，我也已经习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3776a41d78ff7743d0b73c6a6280ab9c3500f76475c90ac4615aa244cea0c51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d989380bab8eb61442b8898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其他学校的朋友，\r\n都说想穿上这身制服呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d77b4e30b1c05036864be85e222c9348d1d719eea7afc26c17f30ea5b32666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de92bf1a1cb48bd29c927c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常轻盈又好行动。\r\n制作的人根本是天才吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db6e346ebfa60e0a5760a38077175ccad42aa5a1ddd552c7ebd4333b69b2457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5431cd96006878c0acf4fc48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服很可爱对吧？\r\n指甲看起来也很美呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c2d69490f14824fc9a90b04514a7d6e0633578f6a4dd28cc6c611fd8b47702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9cae45974bbead6923425d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也要穿穿看吗？\r\n虽然尾巴的地方绝对会很好笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a4aa528b254397935a24225e2224aaab69db708d597b884b4b856a18333b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48060e844902ca13366ef17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实在好看到惊为天人对吧？\r\n上传到UG好了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4120f12837d1eb5eb0108b4995a6b8375e0c2ed1ad5766d070cc65ba34795565",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91ac7f4f3c6ff6678f1dd832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服也是自己设计的。\r\n要是赢了就真的要好好炫耀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f45e70c67c9e79abd8ea2fac47091982513cee618050c8a62a0bf2db66dce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:416e3ac5fcf7ec2c78dbcdd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服不是还满防泼水的吗？\r\n所以我们去海边玩水吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5378a3bf9a7c0f5cbd74bf1405342c64e2f6652d7bf769d4feb0c9a1f97e4bfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76d94061d56006866e34f6b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之先大玩特玩吧！\r\n有什么事就之后再说啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9471c213c658680b1f61457e01fb9844c31ae70ee8ec2575e7f092973aa242e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9facb78474dfa321f957e8da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a5319b6dc8594f7a4fef08ea62d5e97c93e9f70b3dfa5bbf87522c0156a8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65fe36d86d9717526020bb43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完全不觉得会输♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "31a7fc79b58ab256f354a73d863bf0ff59aa67ff2bdcd5356f51ab2b8292861e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299b1efb6ba59796337a5e80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦todaz的打扮怎么样……\r\n咦，to……day？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b44d7b5d0c86c6d39c5b6671b829c24e705acb0bfbdb4f9091f4618b85d4443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6195dadea5ad6603460c3b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你不要像我爸爸一样烦人地\r\n训话。说什么露肚子会着凉之类的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b70bc235945f5104473dd8782e7ae13e836e32f27c4f50fc7a021bfb396b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
