        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed71e583acb2c872816df113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦ー",
      "source_fingerprint": "97036a9936e09ccbaa3452c82844e04a882bac7f088b8f839786af2a70e6b2e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5535044304c54d74e98862df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしと勝負したいとか、マジ？\r\nヤバ、ライバル視的な？\r\n…面白そうじゃん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "654c700cc567f30227972bcf51be8b1c8b3dfc8c99a7a71a4536fcf2ab4c120b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa26b2c599929206810bab7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テンアゲって感じじゃん。\r\nふーん…イイけど？\r\nあたしだってマジになるし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba198b6b524176864956cb9e997b00685776fbb6bae2889de90984164458b8d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35dcb6351f512e518f5a80e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我吃早餐应该\r\n算是日式派的吧。\r\n毕竟味噌汤超好喝的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1f7424bd510b3cf831b917269d0d58a1befe17542b526a838d232812f32e8c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5b5bf82299fbf62299a7a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡醒头发乱翘真的很烦……\r\n想改变发型也都不顺利，\r\n实在有够糟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bfd8bbae1c6b09ac96c7fefd2c73f9878e8f991c2a624235915620d76276346",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c16610da8fbc65eb68276d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃过午餐后很不妙……\r\n呼啊～啊……好困……\r\n我现在哪里都能睡着～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe8cdae93c12773cf0df937d62649be679940391f6f3ef59e8c40ad492fa291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e526dd98e55acfff1d116c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在车站前发现了\r\n一家CP值超高的咖啡厅！\r\n下次要再去吃午餐完全可以～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff77a089f6b1fe59d896728816d390a7504e39b3d8ee78ad4cce23da8fc7d72c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c07f3fbeea5335cda7b267",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我也想熬夜──\r\n但是指甲的状况会变糟，\r\n也只能放弃了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "46769eb18b7931ac9b92d8aef2e216e4ac856c80033289da216fd2e6dfc424dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35937fe2412681b5294ea33a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前果然还是要来一杯热可可～\r\n又暖又甜，还很上相，\r\n根本无可挑剔啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20fefc5d6f51186f81408b660350fecd903530072a916c928b8d83097f3cdede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31be7d436c6296dac1bafb24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节有很多樱花\r\n相关的商品，超可爱～！\r\n也来做有春天感的美甲吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "52660a417ff74aa89c7e303f2ee455a85416a9090daf294e8df679e72aca5d60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48369b676acea58578cbdd2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有和朋友聊说\r\n要称霸全国的祭典，\r\n真能办到就太神了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62930deb71781b441b1dd07aab993c327af9cba189174b5051194d7c28391f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dc192a32c1b51ec5c171e3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么赏枫也可以说「猎」枫啊？？\r\n难不成枫叶以前是活的？\r\n天啊，不会太可怕了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb9b840373ff56c9af247d8fd222f78ad8459ad94adb1d0b3bdbe57a4ff17ba8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e66f35df5083edb9b7178df1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天啊，太冷了吧。\r\n肌肤和指甲都很干燥，\r\n冬天真的要小心才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "716e762b06f32da7a4dbfd7479d4bf1901cb4386fb6230850da38f98b4992eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e00a358b4a3c942e156ce1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶～来去跟姐妹淘逛拍照\r\n景点啰～！真是的，我今天也是四点\r\n就起来了。期待到不行啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc4db599cb7a6d4d70359eb4c89affe651a51d9f1986829b19bc1b92b4992821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d56ae0decb5a7b6ebf2895",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗳～我头发后面会不会怪怪的？\r\n你看得很清楚，应该知道吧？\r\n好啦，快点告诉我嘛──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff097a7116ba035c7ef29ab40dd214500dcf005e4a401920780594458600d046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971204c92424c1a2a2c70d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饮料喝到饱果然是最强的。\r\n好想一直跟死党闲聊下去啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2835cf29feff27edf3fb4f954c18d6a709ac137f047bab3de323e8b27628954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f4befe8f71d0eeb3095d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天哪～购物中心出现了汉堡\r\n激战区！要不要来比较味道看看？\r\n如果你愿意请客，我会更开心心～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7277d89d23df13cf280b4a11e42aac2e8715b91a7df032e0d71761e7f196fbe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49828f4675da6e8cf951b7ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要去夜间游泳池，你也陪我吧～\r\n挨骂的时候再拜托你护航啰，\r\n带队的老师♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8e06770664c249764471f4f5e7871e72d79a478bad05566b6e5e396b726757",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a42eab215db228f472985e97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "累死了，好困！哎唷，\r\n真想直接睡觉……呃，不行不行。\r\n总之得先卸妆……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b985555a8205c079110cabea6d22a05b1c8818ddd1dc621f9b1ec66156fce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841e4998bf087cd4bccef90e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我死党要搬家啦。毕竟是春天？\r\n也没办法？但我叫她做好心理准备，\r\n接受我的LANE贴图轰炸啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8a8aa373dead6c954916741c562cea5cfe13d83078183031cdbe009ec79f6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a300fb07d29dab5b0cedb206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕～真的选不出来！泳装和浴衣\r\n我都想要……等特卖或许有机会\r\n一次买？……啊～钱不够用啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c6c307730067b88c539cf1145b54af7d8b11b76ce38028ae3b47d7b7c9788a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb65c8865dd20381155e286a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你啊，看了一堆跟我有关的\r\n比赛用书？对吧？你整年\r\n都在过阅读之秋喔……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbdc463e1477163463eef4b9497f027f5a6674244f96ed3f4ee02b8cf696a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f98e89e1918991818ed53c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，冷死了……但我今天想穿\r\n露肩装耶……嗳，有没有什么\r\n暖暖的东西能喝？像是可可之类。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ce37fbb7f4cf0aa7bb8f86a2c43253d4554271908612b9d1e7fed1eb64f702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de0acf087f5ab2b22e87955",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4fa391e0db2eece02ef4a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6999ddcd345daac9214871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船那家伙，每次见面都会\r\n缠着我说想和我跑一场。\r\n真的很想叫她别再这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdce81924a4eb048806368e6d74163bbdef9314f3c4dfd94c332b1d3f0ed00b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd538fe08c0153999d5ca02d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我妹妹的个性比较低调，\r\n却说想要和我有一样的衣服，\r\n不觉得很可爱吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "408d90feee3f38bcbf95c5b8433afc5122fa152e9cf3c14dad9c2bdef4e82d5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de351b0d55cd7ffd6ce74cb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贩卖部有在卖\r\n超好吃的葡萄！\r\n啊？也太神了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b57ea9c8cf18947109e8a07d28c6ca55189326410c81d3c461f1ff394576cde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6d23cf7304ee539b170869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质明明很有实力，\r\n却总是很负面呢～\r\n……虽然也不是不能理解啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba27cd340117af0d24915afd3edc9719ebc3aa1fe557661b03037284961eff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:168c31bba2078510ed5b30a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奖券藏不会太容易感动了吗？\r\n只是给她巧克力就大哭，\r\n她的泪腺到底是怎么回事啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c39e52a9575dd9476ca3413da0d5692fdeb543d00af9689e1e65c9ce1ee33a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:051019c653fd17d78229d1cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉会随歌曲摇摆☆\r\n穿上这件，身体似乎就会\r\n擅自摆动，觉得不跳不行呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f9149c09b9cbee59f8ce69671326ff7c63539fdd1ae595870b3e14e56712dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b473daee761d13c010583c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别一直盯着看。\r\n不是站在舞台上，\r\n让人有点无法冷静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837f5980cd271ada74be39d6720755cf96cef3d1046d0da47a84c759a5fa93d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73ce9f0362e199d1437f2aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟是认真设计的决胜服，\r\n这样竞赛时也能充满干劲啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9ba8a6b567108ed45fbc7d84ee516df5e6a65620fdf83dd2084e9666e13e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6226e06937e169d6ca1b54a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想透过这件决胜服，\r\n展现出\r\n自己全力以赴的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bc185b83333daffca1843961e0f0392541af9e1a0f7c118fe8017d49d3e35b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4c47f5ae4d0364ead0e7853",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做晨练？\r\n不能做假想训练就好吗？\r\n……啊，我有自信绝对会睡着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3e6f1e17a41654c041d36c66312063478d227383a02cd94679d2baed4d8251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29fc048d6cbe66b482fab5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道城市有没有空～\r\n问她要不要一起去吃饭吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa7305f0de0d51b5607d8cad44a99a5cdfc74a054f27217972507a5895b512d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72e4eabe40a3c032ead0ea45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕，已经这么晚了？\r\n在睡觉前，\r\n得做好美甲和保湿才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8380d32539d45ba9025914a0d651ddb509905e2e3faa1655016f88b272738ad5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad855ccb923584dae4f7fb86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咖啡厅经常会有樱花口味的东西，\r\n那个到底是什么的味道？\r\n吃下花瓣就会有那样的味道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69631191ef577b81b1cb7a180d4cd55059b1c12338e4616fe55c0112ad1aa44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1a1c11dc03bb7730ee9e97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好难决定浴衣的花色～！\r\n指甲也要配合整体造型，\r\n得仔细考虑才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69f6775a4ba852e82d54f8f49a2db1ee13f7047cbc4fedfa343c98a150f95d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe95b40f20663a6ef06e262a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧柴火后\r\n就冒出浓浓的烟。\r\n……身上应该没有烟臭味吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c0d2d8a229fbf3e61233eaa1b24e07345667741a28e19bd89011da92412634",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8dcb1dcdf3bd2210d47196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴上手套的话，\r\n就会把美甲遮住了～\r\n唔～不过这样真的好冷～",
      "source_fingerprint": "29194a33c9dfbefe932b36073d557e35ea759a6c7b88b8fde5b1810dd62a19fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accc39023c51f0bfe47e9a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，指甲伸出来一下。我找到\r\n以前在百元商店买的指甲油了。\r\n那时候我练得超勤呢。有够怀念啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cee7949f20c6f92efa12e7071e99751f433845799f9f162f1e564554191eaa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556e856db430f6ebb092fc0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸他又～寄了运动服给我。\r\n穿起来很闷热又不舒服……\r\n吼唷，人家衣柜都要塞满了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc63eb41de4e9d061479bab9fb3e8726b0d5778093b09073ba502af1120c2e3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486b40f0a5b9412ba0880bd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天哪！我推的品牌\r\n用城市当海报人物了！\r\n哗……总之那件外套我先买了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce64feb171b14148d21b687b9ea5edb21ec52fbc4d41c090b7cd8d35318efc21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b89e794aef6759d0250074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信她啊，连汉堡也超级会吃的耶！\r\n不觉得很扯吗～？\r\n我刚刚想学怎么吃，结果爆难的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740ce9ba3a0d4f2989e334188e855fa42c6d42f08c4c81f443a19b142feb8d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f409e11f9214dc2d3db9555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去圣代快吃比赛～结果看到太阳\r\n带了把杓子过来！虽然画面看起来\r\n很扯，不过很方便吃耶！超好笑啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "591e18497b093b0a528349f44412b4fad6558258b8ceb592212e99802190ed13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b28f2d867d239221986bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上我擦指甲油的时候，奖券藏的\r\n眼神盯得我整个人没办法专心……\r\n算啦，下次我顺便帮她擦吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57c68db8e011dee59b18794683b7ad9d2c4c9741e827e5747fc9a30cdd38228",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df4edd89e4cc19f0bef70c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗅嗅……顺便跟你说，这罐护发油\r\n和城市是同款的哦～！麝香的味道\r\n闻起来真的很棒呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9133f6d3cb6d7b57d30f35cbd89d86eae76c44b5bd1f18ca37dde7e07d6625d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd38a9fff4bb339bac264ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说啊，不知道为什么我收到了\r\n看起来很贵的烤肉的优惠券耶。\r\n那不就是要我去吃夜宵了吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bb76cb9afaa3ccf6fbc1fc076308319b883777fa502dd23647bbc164b17244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb830450cc900f31c39e55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船追着我大喊什么「我要拿你\r\n来赏花啦」！这套不过就只是\r\n粉红色而已，又不是樱花！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "525a96d88c46754ab0b9107a443d290e5b99ec0a581366193a6bc4c7fecc3165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14af556b4bfde1093948e202",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游泳池跟海边的感觉就是不一样！\r\n轮流去玩也很可以！\r\n然后再来狂拍一大堆影片吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab9d531ee174dc67d8ca4a220d3206e13b9a14e96d42e5333b84e478505776a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284b7c63ca4730a0575462bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天也有一大票祭典，真假？\r\n好想吃摊贩的小吃～！\r\n肚子会很难受～但我就想吃～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b53181efeb3dc96da7510c94a85557e628efb1b478252dd7a85c350173d06a51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd38f2213682685c84a4ec8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也得完全称霸灯饰才行呢～！\r\n像是照亮花海的灯光之类的啊～\r\n根本超赞的吧！我好期待～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c8bb8d103632338de2136af839240d9f3d3c9c93e95ee34bf7256757070e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5f7964c9cd7f6d6ea1f30f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来觉得甜美系穿搭不适合我……\r\n结果好像还算挺上相的？真不愧是\r\n城市！……然后我也很有一套呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18e27736b14ccb99502043f09e8d37e4dccf6b6795cc57f5d16f9287827ef80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74eceb61e16339f24c92d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后面的蝴蝶结有没有松掉？\r\n这很容易松脱啊～你的手很巧，\r\n教我怎么绑才不会掉嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3923e26a89b4fe43ac3a85686f71ce58d68a702dc78e597dffe96a87274a8474",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172686b9bd9d1578b4276665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所以，今天要做什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8260b91169e877bd6741f8cbd7df7bad5349a0f0fc1f1981c0051abb4c468b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d640516fe3ae7e453adc5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うっし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1cf88129b28881b3a3997c345585c02ed377abee0e2ce5ab98b70370bcadda3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "920000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
